        <item>
            <title>0.3.4</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:48:11 +0200</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>202611260247</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Alerts carry a picture in Kakeibo's look: the ensō Gauge on black lacquer with the Used %, in gold, or vermilion with the 家 seal at 90%; a reset shows 0, and the daily numbers show the seal. macOS draws the notification itself, so this picture is the part an app can style.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
