        <item>
            <title>0.3.3</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 11:40:29 +0200</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>202611251139</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Fixed: limits stopped updating about 8 hours after you last ran <code>claude</code> in Terminal ("Showing limits from 8:32 AM…"), even while you used Claude Code in the desktop app. When Claude Code's token expires, Kakeibo now has Claude Code renew it with one tiny Haiku call (about 1,000 tokens, at most every 30 minutes), so limits keep updating, overnight included.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
